{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "CCR's bluesy roots rock connects with what appeals to me in my recent Clapton and Hendrix listening, making it the strongest choice today.",
    "Lynyrd Skynyrd's guitar-driven sound and the Eagles' country rock each connect with parts of my recent listening, even though I would only choose CCR this visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Kansas and early Beatles recordings share a broad rock connection with my listening, but progressive rock and early pop do not satisfy my current interest in bluesy guitar and roots music.",
    "I cannot judge whether Absolutely the Best or NY Greatest Hits suits me without knowing the artist, and I am unlikely to investigate when the connection is uncertain."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The choices seem to assume that an interest in Clapton and Hendrix means I want older rock broadly, although the particular sound matters more to me.",
    "There are many greatest-hits collections, but liking familiar musicians does not mean I am looking for a retrospective collection from each one."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The blues feeling and electric guitar in my recent listening matter more to my choice today than a shared era or broad rock connection.",
    "I can appreciate songwriting or country music without wanting to choose it right now; with my limited interest in browsing, a recommendation needs a clear connection to my current mood."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my interest in established rock and country artists, but only some choices captured the bluesy guitar and roots sound I want today."
}"}
